  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tear the flesh of your opponents more swiftly, and are able to damage their health and vitality.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Boar Style<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may tear flesh more than once per round, against different creatures or against the same opponent, provided you hit with two unarmed strikes for each time you tear flesh. Hence, to tear flesh against the same opponent you would need to hit with at least four unarmed strikes. If you expend one use of mythic power as a swift action when tearing flesh, you deal 1d2 points of Constitution damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
